The DAV module of nginx as a dynamic module: its block of auto/modules for
HTTP_DAV=DYNAMIC too (see patch-auto_options). Its place in the order of the modules
(ngx_module_order: after gzip_static, before autoindex) goes with it.

--- auto/modules.orig
+++ auto/modules
@@ -511,7 +511,7 @@
         . auto/module
     fi
 
-    if [ $HTTP_DAV = YES ]; then
+    if [ $HTTP_DAV != NO ]; then
         have=NGX_HTTP_DAV . auto/have
 
         ngx_module_name=ngx_http_dav_module
